<title>UK: SunTrust Banks sets $300 million 30-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>SunTrust Banks sets $300 million 30-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUNTRUST BANKS INC</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *30-YEAR</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +72-75 BP PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   0.875</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED. *CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
